  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"Standard\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You have line of effect to your convocator.</p><hr></div><p class=\"Standard\">Your pact allows you and your companion to have a direct current of magic with each other. If your next action is to Cast a Spell that has a range, the spell uses your convocator as its origin point. If both you and your convocator are in your Convoker Domains and your spell is a cantrip or focus cantrip, this spellshape becomes a free action.</p>"
